msgstr "The key is good, but “Cloud Translation API” is not turned on in its project. In Google Cloud (console.cloud.google.com) go to “APIs & Services”, search for “Cloud Translation API”, press “Enable”, wait a few minutes and try again."

#: lib/python/Components/HdsConfigurareTraducere.py
msgid ""
"Copiaz-o întreagă din pagina cheii "
