"alt API."
msgstr "Copy it whole from the key page (console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials), without spaces. In the key's project turn on “Cloud Translation API” and check that the key is not restricted to another API."

#: lib/python/Components/HdsConfigurareTraducere.py
msgid ""
"Copiaz-o întreagă din portal (resursa Translator, „Keys and Endpoint”, KEY "
