"westeurope), sau Global dacă resursa e globală."
msgstr "Copy it whole from the portal (the Translator resource, “Keys and Endpoint”, KEY 1), without spaces, and check the region: written exactly as in the portal (for example westeurope), or Global if the resource is global."

#: lib/python/Components/HdsConfigurareTraducere.py
