msgstr "The same settings are on the TV, in __DRUM_MENIU__. Playback uses the mpegts.js library (Apache-2.0), shipped with the image: <a href=\"/tv/mpegts-licenta.txt\">the license</a>. Channels with MPEG-2 picture and AC-3 sound (where the browser does not play it by itself) are decoded in the browser, on the computer's processor, with the FFmpeg decoder (LGPL-2.1), also shipped with the image: <a href=\"/tv/tv-wasm/ffmpeg-licenta.txt\">the license and the source</a>; all the licenses are in <a href=\"/licente\">Licenses</a>."

#: lib/python/Plugins/Extensions/HdsWebControl/retea_web.py
