msgstr "The usual apps for Enigma2 receivers (remote, channels, guide, scheduled recordings, m3u lists) use their usual addresses: <code>/web/...</code> in XML (for example <code>/web/deviceinfo</code>, <code>/web/getservices</code>, <code>/web/zap?sRef=</code>, <code>/web/epgnow?bRef=</code>, <code>/web/timerlist</code>), those with the same names in <code>/api/...</code> in JSON, <code>/picon/</code>, <code>/file?file=</code> (the logos, and for playback on the phone the recordings and movies from the recording places, with <code>Range</code>), <code>/web/ts.m3u?file=</code> and <code>/grab</code>. They are on by default (the “Phone apps” row in the web interface screen and in the Settings page)."

