msgstr "On by default: the large fills on the screen are done on the video card, the rest of the drawing stays on the processor. If problems appear, the receiver switches by itself to the drawing without acceleration. If the picture on the TV still looks wrong, choose “Off” and restart the interface. The same setting is on the TV, in __DRUM_MENIU__."

#: lib/python/Plugins/Extensions/HdsWebControl/retea_web.py
