msgstr "The receiver checks by itself, in the background, whether it has internet: it sends a small DNS question to the public servers 1.1.1.1, 9.9.9.9 and 8.8.8.8, with no data about you. At any change of the network (cable, Wi-Fi, address) it checks immediately. The same setting on the TV: Menu &gt; Settings &gt; Network and Internet &gt; Internet check."

