#: data/setup.xml
msgid "What the receiver notes by itself for the channel search (sound and subtitle languages, teletext, HbbTV). Only the channel watched: what the receiver already knows. The whole transponder: also reads every channel on it from the tuner (not tested yet). Off: nothing; MENU in the channel search still reads them."
msgstr "What the receiver notes by itself for the channel search (sound and subtitle languages, teletext, HbbTV). Only the channel watched: what the receiver already knows. The whole transponder: also reads every channel on it from the tuner (not tested yet). Off: nothing; MENU in the channel search still reads them."

#: data/setup.xml
msgid "2D acceleration on the video card (after GUI restart)"
msgstr "2D acceleration on the video card (after GUI restart)"

#: data/setup.xml
msgid "Off at first. On: the big fills of the screen are done by the video card, the rest is drawn by the processor. If the card works wrong, the receiver goes back to the processor by itself. Used from the next start of the interface."
msgstr "Off at first. On: the big fills of the screen are done by the video card, the rest is drawn by the processor. If the card works wrong, the receiver goes back to the processor by itself. Used from the next start of the interface."

#: lib/python/Components/HdsSubtitrariAspect.py
msgid "Subtitrările DVB sunt imagini trimise de post. „Recunoașterea textului” citește literele și le desenează cu aspectul de mai sus; când textul nu e sigur, rămâne imaginea, mărită clar."
msgstr "DVB subtitles are images sent by the broadcaster. “Text recognition” reads the letters and draws them with the look set above; when the text is not certain, the image stays, clearly enlarged."

#: lib/python/Screens/CleanupWizard.py
msgid "Șterge doar fișiere temporare și cache de pachete; nu atinge NICIODATĂ canale, înregistrări, cronometre sau setări. Pentru resetare completă, folosește „Reset to Factory Defaults” din meniul Sistem."
msgstr "Deletes only temporary files and the package cache; it NEVER touches channels, recordings, timers or settings. For a full reset, use “Reset to Factory Defaults” in the System menu."

