msgstr "The new software is now written to the receiver. Do not unplug the receiver or remove the USB stick while it writes; the interface stops and the receiver restarts by itself at the end."

#: lib/python/Screens/HdsSoftwareUpdate.py
msgid "Receptorul are o singură pereche de nucleu și sistem în memoria internă (fără multiboot): dacă noul software nu pornește, singura reparare este Maintenance Mode, de mână. Înainte de scriere, setările și lista de canale se copiază pe stick."
msgstr "The receiver has a single kernel and system pair in its internal memory (no multiboot): if the new software does not start, the only repair is Maintenance Mode, by hand. Before writing, the settings and the channel list are copied to the USB stick."

