msgstr "While the “SSH access” screen is open on the TV, the remote control and the screenshot work only from a browser connected with the code from the TV."

#: lib/python/Components/HdsAccesSsh.py
msgid "Dacă ai uitat parola, alege „Fă o parolă nouă”."
msgstr "If you forgot the password, choose “Create a new password”."

